  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "What a vendor's own tooling says a sample of its unit processes are worth: each one's cumulative inventory by the vendor's own flow identifiers, the factors that tooling applied, and the scores the two reproduce. Written by tools/export_unit_process_scores.py under brightway; read by compare-scores.",
